<title>USA: Acme Steel to raise prices on some products.</title>
<headline>Acme Steel to raise prices on some products.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERDALE, Ill. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acme Metals Inc's Acme Steel unit said Monday it will raise published base prices about two percent on some hot rolled carbon and alloy sheet and strip steel products.  </p>
<p>The price increases will be effective on shipments April 28 or later, the company said.</p>
<p>The price increase for the products will be $10 per net ton, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
